      description:
        "Knockio includes built-in media management that lets field teams upload photos, videos, and documents directly from the job site, mark up images with annotation tools, and keep every file attached to the correct lead, work order, or customer record.",
      featureList: [
        "Upload inspection photos, damage evidence, measurements, before-and-after shots, completion proof, and project video straight from the job site",
        "Built-in photo annotation to draw, highlight, add arrows, and drop notes directly on an image",
